From 7bc20f7ce2ffdaa2f3caad0cfd368ce6e0dc5dbd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 08:41:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media-driver: Define GFX_CONF_FILE for ANDROID builds

A real flashfiles build failed with 'use of undeclared identifier
GFX_CONF_FILE' in mos_utilities_specific.cpp's MosParseEnvFromConfig(),
a new helper added by the intel-media-26.2.3 upgrade (f2bd97064) that
reads debug-only user-feature-file overrides from a libva-style config
file, modeled on va_parseConfig() in libva/va/va.c.

GFX_CONF_FILE was only defined in the non-ANDROID branch of the
existing USER_FEATURE_FILE* #ifdef block -- upstream never added an
ANDROID-side definition, even though MosParseEnvFromConfig() (which
references the macro directly in its body) is compiled unconditionally
regardless of build type; only its call sites are gated behind
'#if (_DEBUG || _RELEASE_INTERNAL)'.

Added an ANDROID definition following the existing
USER_FEATURE_FILE*'s /vendor/etc/ convention:
/vendor/etc/libva.conf.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 media_softlet/linux/common/os/osservice/mos_utilities_specific.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/media_softlet/linux/common/os/osservice/mos_utilities_specific.h b/media_softlet/linux/common/os/osservice/mos_utilities_specific.h
index 9ef727288..80729b1a2 100644
--- a/media_softlet/linux/common/os/osservice/mos_utilities_specific.h
+++ b/media_softlet/linux/common/os/osservice/mos_utilities_specific.h
@@ -51,6 +51,7 @@ class MosMutex;
 #define USER_FEATURE_FILE                   "/vendor/etc/igfx_user_feature.txt"
 #define USER_FEATURE_FILE_NEXT              "/vendor/etc/igfx_user_feature_next.txt"
 #define USER_FEATURE_FILE_REPORT            "/vendor/etc/igfx_user_feature_report.txt"
+#define GFX_CONF_FILE                       "/vendor/etc/libva.conf"
 #else
 #define USER_FEATURE_FILE                   "/etc/igfx_user_feature.txt"
 #define USER_FEATURE_FILE_NEXT              "/etc/igfx_user_feature_next.txt"
-- 
2.34.1

